{
  "meta": {
    "name": "Effects tour: transitions",
    "description": "Chapter 3 of the effects tour: the basic boundaries (cut, fade, fadeblack, dissolve), every designed transition (push, swipe, zoom-through, iris and the motion-blurred whips) and a few of the xfade catalogue, each beat naming the transition that brought it in.",
    "creativeDirection": "A relay of photographs and ink cards so every boundary has two different pictures to move between. Each incoming beat names its transition in large type: white for the basics and xfade, yellow for the designed ones. Review: no transition is longer than a third of its beat, whips stay under half a second, and every name is readable once the boundary settles."
  },
